lass=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>69%</td><td class='num'><b>26%</b></td><td class='num'>50</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>80%</td><td class='num'><b>31%</b></td><td class='num'>51</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>90%</td><td class='num'><b>40%</b></td><td class='num'>67</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>95%</td><td class='num'><b>40%</b></td><td class='num'>55</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>100%</td><td class='num'><b>71%</b></td><td class='num'>169</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">7 of 8 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Pointe-Noire</b> <span class=\"muted\">Republic of the Congo</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag bad\">Cannot beat climatology</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">7 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>-0.33</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>197&ndash;208\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 213</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>561 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Pointe-Noire &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Pointe-Noire\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=